 "remarks": "A must-see in person-the photos simply don't do this apt or its incredible views justice! Experience downtown Stamford luxury living at The Classic. This sun-filled 1-bedroom condo offers an open floor plan, hardwood floors, a modern kitchen with granite countertops, stainless steel appliances, gas cooking, and an in-unit washer/dryer. The spacious bedroom features two closets and a large marble bathroom. Enjoy breathtaking views from your private 30-foot balcony, accessible from both the living room and bedroom.***Incredible amenities include 24-hour concierge, rooftop heated pool and sundeck, modern, fully equipped fitness center, resident lounge with stunning city views, outdoor grilling and picnic area. Even better....assigned garage parking, water, sewer, trash, HOT WATER, COOKING GAS and all these amenities are INCLUDED IN THE RENT! All just steps from downtown Stamford's restaurants, shopping, and entertainment. Luxury, location, and exceptional value-all in one!***Pet fee: $50/month. Breed restrictions apply.",
